on at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *even*.\n\n- If the graph crosses the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *odd*.\n\nIn our case, the graph is *tangent* to the $x$-axis at $x=-5.$ So, $x=-5$ is a *multiple* root. \n\nFurthermore, the graph crosses the $x$-axis at $x=-5.$ So, $x=-5$ has *odd* multiplicity.\n\nTherefore, $x=-5$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186272220 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "20c9a1ca-cefe-5b47-aaee-3329bf933607" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=9$ is not a root of $p(x)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269545} {:answer/id #uuid "24714aab-9105-5295-aa52-10dea681fb6e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=9$ is a simple root" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186269588} {:answer/id #uuid "5cd73bae-131f-57d4-a900-4c8945260a00" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=9$ is a simple root of even multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186270095} {:answer/id #uuid "8688d1ec-63bc-56c1-8823-f619498f3cd3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=9$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186270437} {:answer/id #uuid "d30100ff-a1e3-54df-99dd-8e30aa0b4c5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=9$ is a multiple root of even multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271127}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8688d1ec-63bc-56c1-8823-f619498f3cd3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$x=9$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186270437} :answer-field/id #uuid "da56c2f6-b6bd-5908-8bba-f09deaba8a80" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186271894}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "20b03eb4-78e8-5fcc-8757-a42acdf8946f" :question/math-academy-id "q-141142" :question/problem "![](images/aa/aa